9,Gur languages Facts for Kids,https://kids.kiddle.co/Gur_languages,"Like many Niger–Congo languages, the very first Gur language probably had a ""noun class"" system. This is like how some languages have different endings for words depending on if they are male or female.Koromfé is one of the few Gur languages that doesn't use tones.",Koromfé,Niger-Congo
